{"pageProps":{"content":{"id":13436,"title":"Versos | “Sono afundado”","shortDescription":"Duanne Ribeiro escreve inspirado por \"After a deep sleep (getting out)\", de Rafael França, obra experimental e pioneira da videoarte brasileira","slug":"versos-sono-afundado","content":"<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&ldquo;Versos&rdquo;&nbsp;<em>destaca produ&ccedil;&otilde;es de artistas presentes na cole&ccedil;&atilde;o de obras de arte do Ita&uacute; Cultural (IC). A cada publica&ccedil;&atilde;o, um escritor &eacute; convidado a criar um poema inspirado em uma obra do acervo. Nesta edi&ccedil;&atilde;o, escreve Duanne Ribeiro</em>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><div class=\"video-frame\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ny0OOi6Yn6s\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong>Rafael Fran&ccedil;a</strong><br />\r\n<em>After a deep sleep (getting out)</em>,<em> </em>1985<br />\r\n4min26s<br />\r\nu-matic transferido para digital&nbsp;<br />\r\nAcervo Ita&uacute; Cultural</p>\r\n\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong>Sono afundado</strong></p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>ela acorda</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">serei sempre</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>ela segura a ma&ccedil;aneta</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">o que esperou</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>e gira, mas n&atilde;o abre, e gira,</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">que lhe abrissem a porta</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>mas n&atilde;o: gira, gira, gira,</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">ao p&eacute; de uma parede com porta</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>(o giro expressa uma ess&ecirc;ncia)</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">e lhe abriram a porta</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>em v&atilde;o; o eixo, no v&atilde;o,</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">e lhe abriram a porta</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>sacode e tilinta e declama</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">e lhe abriram a porta</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>(o oco expressa uma ess&ecirc;ncia)</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">e</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><br />\r\n&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>ela acorda</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">do outro lado</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>ela aspira o cigarro</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">h&aacute; outro lado</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>(o fumo expressa uma ess&ecirc;ncia)</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">CRIAN&Ccedil;A, POR OUTRO LADO,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>(o calor expressa uma ess&ecirc;ncia)</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">EU SOUBE GALGAR BATENTE,</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>ela busca o fundo:</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">mas</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>&ldquo;&eacute; hora de sair daqui&rdquo;</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">serei sempre</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>()</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">o que espera</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;)</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">que lhe abram</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; )</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">uma porta</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; )</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">aberta</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>(&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; )</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><em>ela acorda</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong>Veja tamb&eacute;m:<br />\r\n&gt;&gt;&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://www.itaucultural.org.br/secoes/acervos/experimente-obras-arte-acervo-itau-cultural\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Todos os textos, nas v&aacute;rias curadorias,&nbsp;sobre obras do acervo do Ita&uacute; Cultural</strong></a><br />\r\n<strong>&gt;&gt; Acesse a exposi&ccedil;&atilde;o virtual </strong><a href=\"https://www.itaucultural.org.br/sites/filmes-e-videos-virtual/\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\"><strong><em>Filmes e v&iacute;deos de artistas na cole&ccedil;&atilde;o Ita&uacute; Cultural</em></strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\"><strong>Duanne Ribeiro </strong>&eacute; autor de&nbsp;<a href=\"https://duanneribeiro.info/as-esferas-do-dragao/\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>As esferas do drag&atilde;o</em></strong></a><strong><em>&nbsp;</em></strong>(2019), romance publicado pela Patu&aacute;, e da novela&nbsp;<a href=\"https://gueto.files.wordpress.com/2020/09/breves_ebook_19.pdf\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><em>Trindade</em></strong></a>&nbsp;(2020), pela Gueto Editorial. &Eacute; analista de comunica&ccedil;&atilde;o no IC.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Rafael Fran&ccedil;a</strong> (1957-1991) foi artista visual. Atuou com gravura, xerografia, interven&ccedil;&atilde;o urbana e videoarte. Foi aluno de <a href=\"https://ocupacao.icnetworks.org/ocupacao/regina-silveira/\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Regina Silveira</strong></a> e formou com os artistas <a href=\"https://enciclopedia.itaucultural.org.br/pessoa21081/hudinilson-jr\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Hudinilson Jr.</strong></a> e <a href=\"https://enciclopedia.itaucultural.org.br/pessoa17472/mario-ramiro\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Mario Ramiro</strong></a> o grupo 3N&Oacute;S3. Seu trabalho aborda temas como a homossexualidade e se funda em uma concep&ccedil;&atilde;o do artista como pensador, n&atilde;o restrito a um s&oacute; meio de express&atilde;o. <a href=\"https://enciclopedia.itaucultural.org.br/pessoa17473/rafael-franca\" style=\"color:#0563c1; text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Saiba mais na <em>Enciclop&eacute;dia Ita&uacute; Cultural de arte e cultura brasileira</em></strong></a>.</p>\r\n","publicationDate":"Publicado em 18/10/2022","publishedAt":"2022-10-18T16:58:00.000-03:00","publicationYear":2022,"updatedDate":"Atualizado às 17:36 de 18/10/2022","image":"https://s3.sa-east-1.amazonaws.com/prd.editor.fundacaoitau.org.br/public/image/16158/file/optimized-b28559b96c5f40ff88c03a7b9b6cb61d.png","cover":true,"rights":"Frame do vídeo","cover_position":50,"programs_position":50,"miniature_position":50,"image_description":"No canto esquerdo da tela, uma mulher tenta abrir uma porta.","category":"noticias","ageGroup":"Livre","tags":["literatura","acervos"],"participants":[],"exhibition":false,"occupation":false,"accessibility":{"audio_description":false,"libras":false,"descriptive_subtitle":false,"closed_caption":false,"open_caption":false,"simultaneous_translation":false,"stenotypy":false,"subtitle":false},"page":{"id":13430,"uuid":"29e2aa2c-a822-432a-b717-592a434d7622","pageType":"blocks","position":1,"sections":[{"id":13792,"uuid":"11744e05-7512-4f2f-94e8-867a7bc32269","title":"","position":1,"contentHtml":"<p style=\"margin-left:0cm; margin-right:0cm\">&ldquo;Versos&rdquo;&nbsp;<em>destaca produ&ccedil;&otilde;es de artistas presentes na cole&ccedil;&atilde;o de obras de arte do Ita&uacute; Cultural (IC). A cada publica&ccedil;&atilde;o, um escritor &eacute; convidado a criar um poema inspirado em uma obra 